{"id":"V17-AADDI-PST-1SG","surface":"aaddiyay","lemma":"aaddi","part_of_speech":"verb","conjugation":"2A","tense_aspect":"past","person":"1sg","feature_scope":["lemma","part_of_speech","conjugation","tense_aspect","person"],"source_family":"Hadhwanaag 2020 Wax Tegay natural narrative","source_url":"https://hadhwanaagnews.ca/articles/16456/Wax-Tegay-W-Q-Cabdisalaan-Ceeryaamo","source_date":"2020-07-25","attested_context":"Geelii oo i soo eegaya, ayaan galbeed foolka aaddiyay, dhabarkana bari.","source_note":"The surrounding passage is sustained first-person narration (kaligey, waan xusuustaa, ayaan ...). In the target clause, ayaan resolves the narrator as first-person singular; aaddiyay is therefore scored as 1sg past. Mood is deliberately not scored.","benchmark_role":"positive"}
